sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User (browser)
    participant A as FastAPI on Modal
    participant C as Case store (memory)
    participant M as Muse Spark<br/>Meta Model API
    U->>A: click "Explain it with Muse" (HTMX POST)
    A->>C: cached explanation for this case + language?
    alt cached (or the sample case)
        C-->>A: explanation
    else first click
        A->>A: rate-limit check · redact findings
        A->>M: explanation(verdict, statuses, patterns, incidents)
        M-->>A: overview · per-component meaning + action · steps · glossary
        A->>C: store (gone after 20 min idle)
    end
    A-->>U: swaps the explain section in place (no page reload)
